{"id":"ai-good-prompts","title":"AI: writing a good prompt","subject":"AI prompting","label":"AI prompting","exams":[],"language":"en","seconds":174,"duration":173.85,"audio":"voice.mp3","words":469,"sections":[{"id":"hook","title":"The puzzle","start":0,"end":14.315},{"id":"explain","title":"Five parts","start":14.315,"end":57.325},{"id":"explain2","title":"Iterate","start":57.325,"end":80.245},{"id":"example","title":"Worked example","start":80.245,"end":107.245},{"id":"check","title":"Quick check","start":107.245,"end":116.065},{"id":"answer","title":"Answer","start":116.065,"end":130.885},{"id":"mistakes","title":"Common mistakes","start":130.885,"end":153.195},{"id":"recap","title":"Recap","start":153.195,"end":173.85}],"lines":[{"s":0,"a":0.5,"b":4.17,"text":"Have you ever asked for help and got an answer that missed the point?","w":[0.54,0.72,0.9,1.22,1.46,1.64,2.28,2.42,2.64,2.78,3.1,3.32,3.64,3.76]},{"s":0,"a":4.62,"b":7.46,"text":"I'm Kora. A model cannot read your mind.","w":[4.72,4.92,5.88,5.98,6.36,6.72,6.92,7.1]},{"s":0,"a":7.76,"b":11.85,"text":"It only has your words. So a vague prompt gets a vague answer.","w":[7.84,8.06,8.34,8.54,8.72,9.58,9.82,9.94,10.32,10.7,10.98,11.1,11.5]},{"s":0,"a":12.15,"b":13.89,"text":"The fix is simpler than you think.","w":[12.18,12.34,12.7,12.84,13.24,13.4,13.54]},{"s":1,"a":14.74,"b":19.2,"text":"A prompt is the instruction you give the model. A strong prompt has five parts.","w":[14.82,14.94,15.38,15.5,15.62,16.18,16.32,16.52,16.62,17.34,17.44,17.84,18.2,18.42,18.72]},{"s":1,"a":19.5,"b":27.68,"text":"First, the task. Say exactly what you want done, with a clear action word like explain, summarise, compare, or list.","w":[19.54,20.22,20.34,21.28,21.5,22.04,22.2,22.34,22.54,23.12,23.3,23.4,23.74,24.04,24.66,24.96,25.9,26.52,27.12,27.28]},{"s":1,"a":27.98,"b":33.38,"text":"Second, the context. Who you are, your level, and what it is for. This sets the tone.","w":[28.14,28.76,28.9,29.8,30,30.26,30.42,30.62,30.98,31.12,31.3,31.4,31.58,32.34,32.6,32.92,33.04]},{"s":1,"a":33.68,"b":39.12,"text":"Third, the format. A list of five points, a table, or two short paragraphs.","w":[33.7,34.34,34.46,35.28,35.36,35.62,35.74,36.06,36.86,36.92,37.74,37.9,38.18,38.44]},{"s":1,"a":39.42,"b":44.51,"text":"Fourth, the constraints. Length, tone, what to leave out, and the language.","w":[39.48,40.18,40.3,41.38,42.12,42.86,43.06,43.16,43.42,43.94,44.06,44.18]},{"s":1,"a":44.81,"b":47.92,"text":"Fifth, if you can, an example of what good looks like.","w":[44.84,45.42,45.52,45.66,46.3,46.4,46.86,46.96,47.16,47.4,47.64]},{"s":1,"a":48.22,"b":51.5,"text":"Even one small example shows the model the style you want.","w":[48.28,48.64,48.88,49.22,49.76,50.1,50.2,50.58,50.72,51.12,51.28]},{"s":1,"a":51.8,"b":56.9,"text":"You can also give a role, such as act as a patient physics teacher, to set the level and tone.","w":[51.82,51.96,52.18,52.48,52.68,52.78,53.4,53.62,53.88,54.1,54.24,54.32,54.7,55.02,55.6,55.74,55.94,56.06,56.4,56.54]},{"s":2,"a":57.75,"b":60.61,"text":"Say what to do, rather than only what not to do.","w":[57.86,58.06,58.24,58.38,59.06,59.34,59.58,59.82,60.04,60.26,60.38]},{"s":2,"a":60.91,"b":65.92,"text":"If you have long material, such as your notes, put it clearly separated from the instruction.","w":[61,61.1,61.28,61.5,61.76,62.48,62.7,62.78,62.96,63.8,63.98,64.14,64.58,65.1,65.26,65.38]},{"s":2,"a":66.22,"b":71.34,"text":"Then iterate. Read the answer, and follow up with shorter, simpler, or give another example.","w":[66.28,66.54,67.38,67.58,67.76,68.42,68.6,68.96,69.08,69.28,69.74,70.26,70.38,70.58,70.88]},{"s":2,"a":71.64,"b":74.34,"text":"A follow up can be one word, like shorter.","w":[71.7,71.84,72.24,72.4,72.58,72.84,73.02,73.64,73.9]},{"s":2,"a":74.64,"b":76.81,"text":"Each follow up is a new, better prompt.","w":[74.74,75.04,75.42,75.66,75.8,75.9,76.12,76.38]},{"s":2,"a":77.11,"b":79.82,"text":"The first answer is a draft, not the final word.","w":[77.14,77.28,77.6,77.9,78.02,78.1,78.82,79.02,79.16,79.48]},{"s":3,"a":80.67,"b":86.25,"text":"Here is a weak prompt. Explain photosynthesis. It lacks context and format.","w":[80.72,81.04,81.18,81.3,81.6,82.54,83.06,84.44,84.58,84.94,85.54,85.7]},{"s":3,"a":86.55,"b":88.14,"text":"Now listen to the improvement.","w":[86.64,86.96,87.28,87.38,87.5]},{"s":3,"a":88.44,"b":90.79,"text":"I am fifteen and revising biology.","w":[88.54,88.68,88.86,89.52,89.64,90.18]},{"s":3,"a":91.09,"b":98.53,"text":"Explain photosynthesis in five short bullet points, in simple words, then give me three practice questions with answers at the end.","w":[91.16,91.66,92.6,92.78,93.12,93.44,93.74,94.18,94.34,94.7,95.5,95.86,96.06,96.26,96.56,97,97.44,97.68,98.08,98.16,98.34]},{"s":3,"a":98.83,"b":100.88,"text":"Notice how each part does its job.","w":[98.94,99.28,99.54,99.78,100.12,100.34,100.5]},{"s":3,"a":101.18,"b":106.82,"text":"That prompt names the task, the context, the format, the constraints, and a clear finish.","w":[101.22,101.5,101.96,102.28,102.42,103.04,103.2,104.02,104.2,104.9,105.02,105.88,106,106.1,106.4]},{"s":4,"a":107.67,"b":111.44,"text":"Quick check. Improve this prompt. Write about climate change.","w":[107.72,108,108.76,109.14,109.36,110.16,110.38,110.62,111]},{"s":4,"a":111.74,"b":113.3,"text":"Name two things you would add.","w":[111.82,112.2,112.46,112.72,112.84,113.06]},{"s":4,"a":113.6,"b":115.64,"text":"Pause here and try it. I'll wait.","w":[113.64,113.98,114.28,114.4,114.68,115.1,115.3]},{"s":5,"a":116.49,"b":119.42,"text":"You could add the purpose and audience, and the length.","w":[116.52,116.68,116.98,117.14,117.28,117.82,118.04,118.88,119.02,119.14]},{"s":5,"a":119.72,"b":125.8,"text":"For example, write a short explanation of climate change for a fifteen year old student, in two paragraphs.","w":[119.74,119.96,120.72,120.96,121.06,121.36,121.94,122.06,122.44,122.76,122.94,123.06,123.5,123.7,123.88,124.7,124.86,125.1]},{"s":5,"a":126.1,"b":130.46,"text":"The reason is simple. Those details tell the model what a good answer looks like.","w":[126.14,126.3,126.66,126.8,127.8,128.1,128.64,128.84,128.96,129.24,129.4,129.46,129.7,129.96,130.18]},{"s":6,"a":131.31,"b":137.48,"text":"Three common mistakes. First, a one line prompt with no context. Add your level and purpose.","w":[131.34,131.66,132.04,132.82,133.26,133.44,133.62,133.92,134.3,134.52,134.74,136.1,136.26,136.46,136.82,136.96]},{"s":6,"a":137.78,"b":144.9,"text":"Second, asking for many different things at once, or not saying the format you need. Split the request, and name the format.","w":[137.88,138.6,138.92,139.12,139.38,139.68,139.96,140.16,140.56,140.74,141.02,141.32,141.46,141.88,142.02,142.72,143.06,143.16,143.96,144.12,144.38,144.48]},{"s":6,"a":145.2,"b":152.77,"text":"Third, accepting the first answer, or pasting private information. Treat it as a draft, and never share private details.","w":[145.22,145.88,146.34,146.46,146.84,147.42,147.58,148.04,148.38,149.6,149.84,149.96,150.08,150.16,151.02,151.22,151.56,151.88,152.22]},{"s":7,"a":153.62,"b":158.81,"text":"Recap. First, give the task, context, format, constraints, and an example.","w":[153.68,154.56,154.92,155.12,155.24,155.9,156.52,157.12,158.08,158.24,158.34]},{"s":7,"a":159.11,"b":163.07,"text":"Second, say what to do, and separate long notes from the instruction.","w":[159.24,159.92,160.12,160.3,160.42,160.98,161.14,161.64,161.94,162.24,162.4,162.52]},{"s":7,"a":163.37,"b":167.14,"text":"Third, iterate, because the first answer is a draft.","w":[163.4,164.18,165.12,165.42,165.56,165.92,166.44,166.56,166.64]},{"s":7,"a":167.44,"b":170.47,"text":"Top tip: a clear prompt is a kindness to yourself.","w":[167.46,167.76,168.5,168.62,168.94,169.36,169.48,169.56,169.98,170.08]},{"s":7,"a":170.77,"b":173.25,"text":"Knowzone is here whenever you want to practise.","w":[170.84,171.48,171.62,171.92,172.3,172.44,172.6,172.7]}],"scenes":[{"at":0.25,"heading":"The puzzle","items":[{"at":0.4,"kind":"text","text":"Asked for help, got an answer that missed the point?"},{"at":4.52,"kind":"text","text":"A model cannot read your mind."},{"at":7.66,"kind":"text","text":"Vague prompt → vague answer."},{"at":12.05,"kind":"text","text":"The fix is simpler than you think."}]},{"at":14.49,"heading":"Five parts of a prompt","items":[{"at":14.64,"kind":"term","text":"Prompt","detail":"The instruction you give the model."},{"at":19.4,"kind":"term","text":"Task","detail":"Say exactly what to do: explain, summarise, compare, list."},{"at":27.88,"kind":"term","text":"Context","detail":"Who you are, your level, and what it is for; sets tone."}]},{"at":33.43,"heading":"Five parts (cont.)","items":[{"at":33.58,"kind":"term","text":"Format","detail":"List of five points, a table, or two short paragraphs."},{"at":39.32,"kind":"term","text":"Constraints","detail":"Length, tone, what to leave out, and language."},{"at":44.71,"kind":"term","text":"Example","detail":"If you can, show what good looks like."},{"at":48.12,"kind":"text","text":"Even one small example shows style."},{"at":51.7,"kind":"term","text":"Role","detail":"Act as a patient physics teacher; sets level and tone."}]},{"at":57.5,"heading":"Prompt habits","items":[{"at":57.65,"kind":"text","text":"Say what to do, not only what not to do."},{"at":60.81,"kind":"text","text":"Separate long notes from the instruction."},{"at":66.12,"kind":"term","text":"Iterate","detail":"Read answer; follow up: shorter, simpler, example."}]},{"at":71.39,"heading":"Iterate","items":[{"at":71.54,"kind":"text","text":"Follow up can be one word: shorter."},{"at":74.54,"kind":"text","text":"Each follow up is a new prompt."},{"at":77.01,"kind":"text","text":"First answer is a draft."}]},{"at":80.42,"heading":"Worked example","items":[{"at":80.57,"kind":"text","text":"Weak: Explain photosynthesis. Lacks context/format."},{"at":88.34,"kind":"text","text":"I am 15 and revising biology."},{"at":90.99,"kind":"text","text":"Explain photosynthesis: 5 bullets, simple words."},{"at":90.99,"kind":"text","text":"Then 3 practice Qs + answers."},{"at":101.08,"kind":"text","text":"Task, context, format, constraints, finish."}]},{"at":107.25,"heading":"Quick check","items":[{"at":107.25,"kind":"question","text":"Improve this prompt: Write about climate change. Name two things you would add."}]},{"at":116.24,"heading":"Answer","items":[{"at":116.39,"kind":"text","text":"Add purpose/audience and length."},{"at":119.62,"kind":"text","text":"E.g. short explanation for a 15-year-old, two paragraphs"},{"at":126,"kind":"text","text":"Details show what a good answer looks like."}]},{"at":131.06,"heading":"Common mistakes","items":[{"at":131.21,"kind":"wrong","text":"One line prompt, no context."},{"at":131.21,"kind":"right","text":"Add your level and purpose."},{"at":137.68,"kind":"wrong","text":"Many things at once; no format named."},{"at":137.68,"kind":"right","text":"Split the request; name the format."},{"at":145.1,"kind":"wrong","text":"Accepting first answer; sharing private info."}]},{"at":153.37,"heading":"Recap","items":[{"at":153.52,"kind":"text","text":"Task, context, format, constraints, example."},{"at":159.01,"kind":"text","text":"Say what to do; separate long notes."},{"at":163.27,"kind":"text","text":"Iterate: first answer is a draft."},{"at":167.34,"kind":"tip","text":"A clear prompt is a kindness to yourself."},{"at":170.67,"kind":"text","text":"Knowzone: practise whenever you want."}]}],"check":{"at":115.89,"seconds":10,"question":"Improve this prompt: Write about climate change. Name two things you would add.","answer":"Add purpose/audience and length, e.g. a short explanation for a 15-year-old in two paragraphs."},"fps":30,"mouth":"","level":"","credits":[],"voice":"qwen3-tts-12hz-1.7b (cloned voice)"}